            <span class="font-display font-bold text-gold text-2xl">5/10</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Institutions bend but do not break. Road blockades and protests cause disruption, not collapse.
            The Yungas is peripheral to political violence but vulnerable to supply disruption.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-bark-800/50 border border-bark-700 rounded-xl p-8 reveal" data-delay="250">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
